            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="ckeditor-grid" style="max-width:320px; margin:auto">
<div class="ckeditor-grid-item">
<p style="text-align:center"><a href="https://fr.bartonccc.edu/services/advising" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><img alt="Fort Leonard Wood Students" height="213" src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/53861752434_7e8ae43b07_b.jpg" width="320" /> </a></p>
<h3 class="text-align-center">Barton Expands to<br />
Fort Leonard Wood, Missouri</h3>
<p class="text-align-center">Flexible Live Online and Barton Online courses give military-connected students options designed to fit military, work and family life.</p>
