        <div class="block block-block-content block-block-content6a0e5cde-e566-4a44-b19b-ac0054ce73c4">
  
    
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="ckeditor-grid" style="max-width:320px; margin:auto">
<div class="ckeditor-grid-item">
<h3 class="text-align-center"><img alt="" height="214" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," width="320" /></h3>
<h3 class="text-align-center">Serving Those Who Serve:<br />
Build Your Career in Federal HR</h3>
<p class="text-align-center">Designed for transitioning servicemembers, military spouses, and civilian learners, Barton's Federal Human Resources program equips you with the skills to step directly into federal HR roles! </p>
<p class="text-align-center"><a class="btn" href="https://bartonccc.edu/programs/federal-hr" style="width:60%" target="_blank">START YOUR JOURNEY</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
      
  </div>

      </div>
    
          <div  class="layout__region layout__region--third">
        <div class="block block-block-content block-block-content349e6f0c-8284-4c62-bb7c-859755a4e543">
  
    
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="ckeditor-grid" style="max-width:320px; margin:auto">
<div class="ckeditor-grid-item">
<p style="text-align:center"><img alt="" height="213" src="https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/53532975871_b9bfd987ec_6k.jpg" width="320" /></p>
<h3 class="text-align-center">Program Highlight:<br />
Scales Tech</h3>
<p class="text-align-center">Barton’s <strong>Scale Technician Certificate Program</strong> equips students with the essential technical skills needed to enter the weights and measures industry—a field with growing demand and career stability.</p>
<p class="text-align-center"><a class="btn" href="https://bartonccc.edu/programs/scale-tech" style="width:50%" target="_blank">CHECK IT OUT</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
      
  </div>

      </div>
    
  </div>

    <div  class="row section_colorbar" style="background-color:#f0f0f0; color:#5c5c5c">
        
                    <div  class="col-xs-9" style="background-color:#f0f0f0">
                
<div class="block block-block-content block-block-content279f2f78-eea6-4e46-aea2-1d24330dbd11 component component_colorbar" style="background-color: #f0f0f0;color: #5c5c5c;">
    
            
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><h3>Barton Named Aspen Top 200</h3>
<p> <br />
Barton Community College is proud to be named an Aspen Top 200 finalist, a prestigious national recognition that honors community colleges for excellence in student success and outcomes. The designation reflects Barton’s ongoing commitment to helping students complete their education, prepare for meaningful careers, and make a positive impact in their communities. <a href="/news/aspen-award">Read more →</a><br />
 </p>
<p><a class="btn-4" href="https://bartonccc.edu/news/aspen-award" style="width: 230px; height: 100%; padding: 10px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;" target="_blank">LEARN MORE ABOUT<br />
THE ASPEN INSTITUTE</a></p>
</div>
      
    </div>

            </div>
                            <div  class="col-xs-3" style="background-color:#f0f0f0">
                <div class="block block-layout-builder block-inline-blockcomponent-media-and-caption component component_media_and_caption">
    
            
            <div class="field field--name-field-media field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__item">    <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--media-video paragraph--view-mode--captioned-media">
