    <div class="news-title">
        <a href="/news/hosa-western-regional-leadership-conference"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Barton Brings HOSA Competition Farther West Than Ever Before</span>
</a>
    </div>
    <div class="news-body">
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>More than 100 high school students from across Kansas gathered at Barton Community College Nov. 9 to participate in healthcare-focused competitions and skills training at the HOSA Western Regional Leadership Conference. </p>
</div>
      
    </div>

</article>
