    <div class="news-title">
        <a href="/news/kansas-corequisite-symposium-26"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Barton welcomes educators from across Kansas for second annual Corequisite Symposium</span>
</a>
    </div>
    <div class="news-body">
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Barton Community College hosted approximately 110 higher education professionals from across Kansas Oct. 23 for the 2026 Kansas Corequisite Symposium, which focused on improving student success through innovative instructional practices and academic support.</p>
</div>
      
    </div>

</article>
</div>
