    <div class="news-title">
        <a href="/news/jack-kilby-stem-day-2026"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">22nd Annual Jack Kilby STEM Day highlighted pathways to STEM Careers</span>
</a>
    </div>
    <div class="news-body">
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Barton Community College welcomed more than 200 high school students from 19 schools to campus for the Annual Jack Kilby STEM Day (JKSD) on Nov. 6.</p>
</div>
      
    </div>

</article>
</div>
        <div class="views-row">
