    <div class="news-title">
        <a href="/news/-nutcracker-for-the-golden-belt-26"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Barton Community College Dance program to present “The Nutcracker for the Golden Belt”</span>
</a>
    </div>
    <div class="news-body">
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>One of the most internationally renowned and iconic ballet productions will be brought to life as the Barton Dance program, in collaboration with Aly’s Dance Studio and dancers from around the region, presents “The Nutcracker for the Golden Belt” from Nov. 20-21 at 7 p.m. and 2 p.m. Nov. 22 in the Fine Arts Auditorium on the Barton campus.</p>
</div>
      
    </div>

</article>
