        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="news-title">
        <a href="/news/kmta-mtna-awards-26"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Barton music students earn top honors at statewide competition</span>
</a>
    </div>
    <div class="news-body">
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Four Barton Community College music students earned honors at the Kansas Music Teachers Association (KMTA) and Music Teachers National Association (MTNA) State Competitions held recently at the University of Kansas in Lawrence, competing against collegiate musicians from institutions across the state.</p>
</div>
      
    </div>

</article>
