</a>
    </div>
    <div class="news-body">
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>The Shafer Art Gallery at Barton Community College will host a free opening reception from 4-6 p.m. Nov. 13 for an exhibition featuring the work of sculptor Glenn Zweygardt and painter Michael Jilg. The exhibition will run through Dec. 12.</p>
